  "content": "<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style>\n:root {\n  --mg-red:     #c8352e;\n  --mg-dark:    #0a0a0a;\n  --mg-text:    #3a3a3a;\n  --mg-muted:   #71717a;\n  --mg-surface: #f5f5f3;\n  --mg-border:  #e4e4e7;\n}\n\n.title { display: none !important; }\n\n.sg {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  font-size: 1.05rem;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: var(--mg-text);\n  max-width: 760px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.sg-h1 {\n  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);\n  color: var(--mg-dark);\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.sg-h2 {\n  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  color: var(--mg-dark);\n  margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--mg-surface);\n  padding-bottom: 0.3rem;\n}\n\n.sg-fit-notice {\n  background: var(--mg-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--mg-red);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;\n  margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n\n.sg-fit-notice strong {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--mg-dark);\n}\n\n.sg-toggle {\n  display: flex;\n  background: var(--mg-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  border-radius: 50px;\n  padding: 4px;\n  width: fit-content;\n  margin: 0 0 2rem;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.sg-toggle-btn {\n  padding: 10px 28px;\n  border-radius: 50px;\n  border: none;\n  background: transparent;\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.sg-toggle-btn.active {\n  background: var(--mg-dark);\n  color: #fff;\n}\n\n.sg-panel { display: none; }\n.sg-panel.active { display: block; }\n\n.sg-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin: 0 0 2.5rem; }\n\n.sg-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  font-size: 0.93rem;\n}\n\n.sg-table th {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  background: var(--mg-surface);\n  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--mg-border);\n  padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;\n  text-align: left;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.sg-table td {\n  padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  color: var(--mg-text);\n}\n\n.sg-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }\n\n.sg-table td:first-child {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--mg-dark);\n}\n\n.sg-age {\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  font-weight: 400;\n}\n\n.sg-note {\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  padding-top: 1.25rem;\n  margin-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n.sg-note strong { color: var(--mg-dark); }\n.sg-note a { color: var(--mg-red); }\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .sg-toggle { width: 100%; }\n  .sg-toggle-btn { flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 0.78rem; }\n  .sg-table th, .sg-table td { font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem; }\n  .hide-sm { display: none; }\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sg\">\n  <h1 class=\"sg-h1\">Guide des Tailles</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"sg-fit-notice\">\n    <strong>Nos maillots sont coupés dans un style athlétique ajusté.</strong>\n    Si vous êtes entre deux tailles ou si vous préférez une coupe plus ample sur le terrain,\n    <strong>nous vous recommandons de prendre la taille supérieure.</strong>\n    Toutes les mesures ci-dessous sont des mesures corporelles — pas des mesures du vêtement.\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sg-toggle\" role=\"tablist\">\n    <button class=\"sg-toggle-btn active\" data-panel=\"adult\" role=\"tab\">Adultes</button>\n    <button class=\"sg-toggle-btn\" data-panel=\"kids\" role=\"tab\">Enfants / Jeunes</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── ADULTES ── -->\n  <div class=\"sg-panel active\" id=\"sg-adult\">\n\n    <h2 class=\"sg-h2\">Maillots de Football</h2>\n    <div class=\"sg-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"sg-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Taille</th>\n            <th>Poitrine (cm)</th>\n            <th class=\"hide-sm\">Poids (kg)</th>\n            <th>Hauteur (cm)</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>XS</td><td>86–91</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">50–60</td><td>160–165</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>S</td><td>91–96</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">60–70</td><td>165–170</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>M</td><td>96–101</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">70–80</td><td>170–175</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>L</td><td>101–106</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">80–90</td><td>175–180</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>XL</td><td>106–111</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">90–100</td><td>180–185</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>2XL</td><td>111–116</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">100–110</td><td>185–190</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>3XL</td><td>116–121</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">110–120</td><td>190–195</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"sg-h2\">Shorts de Football</h2>\n    <div class=\"sg-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"sg-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Taille</th>\n            <th>Tour de taille (cm)</th>\n            <th class=\"hide-sm\">Hanches (cm)</th>\n            <th>Hauteur (cm)</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>XS</td><td>73–90</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">85–90</td><td>160–180</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>S</td><td>79–96</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">91–96</td><td>165–185</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>M</td><td>85–102</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">97–102</td><td>170–190</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>L</td><td>91–108</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">103–108</td><td>175–195</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>XL</td><td>97–114</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">109–114</td><td>180–200</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>2XL</td><td>103–120</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">115–120</td><td>185–205</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>3XL</td><td>109–126</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">121–126</td><td>185–205</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── ENFANTS / JEUNES ── -->\n  <div class=\"sg-panel\" id=\"sg-kids\">\n\n    <h2 class=\"sg-h2\">Maillots de Football — Enfants / Jeunes</h2>\n    <div class=\"sg-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"sg-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Taille</th>\n            <th>Poitrine (cm)</th>\n            <th class=\"hide-sm\">Poids (kg)</th>\n            <th>Hauteur (cm)</th>\n            <th>Âge (approx.)</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>98/104</td><td>54–58</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">15–18</td><td>96–104</td><td class=\"sg-age\">3–4 ans</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>110/116</td><td>58–64</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">18–22</td><td>105–117</td><td class=\"sg-age\">5–6 ans</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>128</td><td>64–70</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">22–28</td><td>123–128</td><td class=\"sg-age\">7–8 ans</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>140</td><td>70–76</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">28–36</td><td>135–140</td><td class=\"sg-age\">9–10 ans</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>152</td><td>76–82</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">34–42</td><td>147–152</td><td class=\"sg-age\">11–12 ans</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>164</td><td>82–88</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">40–52</td><td>159–164</td><td class=\"sg-age\">13–14 ans</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"sg-h2\">Shorts de Football — Enfants / Jeunes</h2>\n    <div class=\"sg-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"sg-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Taille</th>\n            <th>Tour de taille (cm)</th>\n            <th class=\"hide-sm\">Hanches (cm)</th>\n            <th>Hauteur (cm)</th>\n            <th>Âge (approx.)</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>98/104</td><td>52–55</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">58–61</td><td>96–104</td><td class=\"sg-age\">3–4 ans</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>110/116</td><td>54–58</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">62–66</td><td>105–117</td><td class=\"sg-age\">5–6 ans</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>128</td><td>59–62</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">68–71</td><td>123–128</td><td class=\"sg-age\">7–8 ans</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>140</td><td>63–67</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">74–79</td><td>135–140</td><td class=\"sg-age\">9–10 ans</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>152</td><td>66–72</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">79–84</td><td>147–152</td><td class=\"sg-age\">11–12 ans</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>164</td><td>71–75</td><td class=\"hide-sm\">86–90</td><td>159–164</td><td class=\"sg-age\">13–14 ans</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sg-note\">\n    <p><strong>Vous n'êtes pas sûr de votre taille ?</strong> Mesurez votre poitrine à son point le plus large et votre hauteur sans chaussures, puis comparez avec le tableau. En cas de doute, prenez la taille supérieure — les maillots personnalisés ne peuvent pas être échangés une fois imprimés.</p>\n    <p>Des questions ? <a href=\"/pages/contactez-nous\">Contactez notre équipe</a> — nous sommes ravis de vous aider avant votre commande.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var btns = document.querySelectorAll('.sg-toggle-btn');\n  btns.forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      btns.forEach(function (b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });\n      btn.classList.add('active');\n      document.querySelectorAll('.sg-panel').forEach(function (p) { p.classList.remove('active'); });\n      document.getElementById('sg-' + btn.dataset.panel).classList.add('active');\n    });\n  });\n}());\n</script>\n",
